    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d409-a1">

                <pb facs="0521" n="437" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg437"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Notice regarding the raising of the blockade of the
                        Venezuelan ports of Puerto Cabello and Maracaibo.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-02-16"><hi rendition="#small-caps">February</hi> 16,
                            1903</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The differences between Germany and the United States of Venezuela having been
                    settled, the blockade which the active naval forces of Germany maintained at the
                    ports of Puerto Cabello and Maracaibo (see No. 299 of the “Reichsanzeiger” of
                    the 20th of December, 1902) has been raised.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Berlin</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1903-02-16">February 16,
                        1903</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Graf von Bulow</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">The Imperial Chancellor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
